<h2>Profile Reported</h2>

<p><strong>Reported profile:</strong> <%= @report.reported_profile.unique_id %> (<%= @report.reported_profile.name %>, account: <%= @report.reported_profile.user&.email %>, <%= @report.reported_profile.user&.phone_number %>)</p>

<p><strong>Reason:</strong> <%= @report.reason_label %></p>

<% if @report.reason == 'underage' %>
<p style="color:#b00020;"><strong>Child safety report: review it today.</strong> If the member may be under 18, deactivate the account straight away. If there is any sign of child sexual abuse or exploitation, keep the evidence and report it to the authorities as set out in the Child Safety Standards (bolokobul.com/child-safety).</p>
<% end %>

<% if @report.details.present? %>
<p><strong>What happened:</strong><br><%= simple_format(@report.details) %></p>
<% end %>

<p><strong>Reported by:</strong> <%= @report.reporter_profile&.unique_id %> (<%= @report.reporter_profile&.user&.email %>)</p>

<p><strong>Reported:</strong> <%= @report.created_at.in_time_zone('Asia/Dhaka').strftime('%-d %B %Y, %-I:%M %p') %> (Bangladesh time)</p>

<p><strong>Members who have reported this profile so far:</strong> <%= @report.reporter_count %><%= ' &mdash; please review it today.'.html_safe if @report.reporter_count >= 3 %></p>

<p>Review it in the admin panel under <strong>User &rarr; Profile Reports</strong>. To stop the profile, deactivate the member's account.</p>
